# Design

Direction: **Apple-native travel utility with quiet intelligence.** Match `design/ui-flow-overview.png`. Do not invent a second visual language.

## Tokens

- SF Pro + Dynamic Type. No custom display fonts for body UI
- SF Symbols, outline style
- Primary blue for CTAs, selected chips, progress, key icons
- Semantic system colors only — never hardcode `#FFFFFF` / `#000000`
- Soft card shadows, generous whitespace, subtle materials
- Tokenize colors in `DesignSystem/` when implementation starts

## Components

- Native navigation, sheets, context menus, date pickers, Swift Charts
- Setup: Back / Next header, not custom wizard chrome
- Tab bar: Trips + Me
- Packing: Reminders-style rows, not per-item cards
- Cards: upcoming trip, weather, weather-changed, Final Check, suggestions
- Item detail and Add Item: bottom sheets
- Trip Detail: floating **+**
- 44pt minimum targets

## Photography

Allowed: onboarding welcome, trip hero, past-trip card, completed-trip moment. Not on the packing list.

## Motion

Check item → light haptic. Category complete → stronger. 100% → small suitcase moment. Weather change → quiet transition. No confetti. Honor Reduce Motion.

## Dark Mode and a11y

Dark Mode from day one. Ship Dynamic Type, VoiceOver, Reduce Motion, high contrast, color-independent packed/important/weather state, F/C and Imperial/Metric.

